#: 78022f249d0147f0aeeee92e39803ff3
msgid "WSL1 vs WSL2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows10.rst:61
#: c727334d5669497082beabd1828e4c67
msgid "WSL2 is the latest version of the Windows10 Subsystem for Linux. It is many times faster than WSL1 and is therefore preferred for building the code in terms of compilation speed. It can also run MAVProxy and native SITL.  However, it does not support the following yet:"
msgstr ""

